# Experiment 2 — change the curator prompt.
#
# PROMPTS_DIR is an overlay: a directory that need only contain the prompt files
# it changes. Copy prompts/suggest.md into profiles/offline/overlays/curator-prompt/,
# edit it there, and the rest of the prompts keep coming from prompts/.
#
# The fingerprint follows prompt CONTENT, so the variant this resolves to
# changes the moment you edit that copy — and every post it produces is stamped
# with the changed fingerprint.
PROMPTS_DIR=$BLOG_REPO_DIR/profiles/offline/overlays/curator-prompt
